Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,AZALEA FANSUB GROUP PRESENTS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807}\fscy2007 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,nagtrabaho,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Gumawa sa serye:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Pebrero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}Paano ako naging
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,pangalan,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}reyna
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.03,0:01:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Lahat ng character ay kathang-isip lang,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.53,0:01:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,at ang mga kaganapang ipinakita ay kathang-isip lamang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.18,0:01:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,May nalaman ba si Hong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Malamang, nahulaan ni Kim Byungin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.98,0:01:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,na ang piraso ng tela na natagpuan niya ay mula sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Papalapit na siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bilisan din natin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Natututo kaming huwag umatake.\N-Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.49,0:02:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong problema mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala sa iyong mga panuntunan ang pagkawala ng isip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Matagal na akong nagtitimpi,\Nand pagod na akong maghintay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.21,0:03:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mga Mapanganib na Uugnayan
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.95,0:03:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,8 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.35,0:03:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nangaso ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaya ng sinasabi nila: "Magpahinga..."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"Magpahinga at maghintay hanggang mapagod sila."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Habang nagpapahinga ako, napapagod ang mga kalaban ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit paano mo nahuli ang liyebre nang walang pana?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.28,0:04:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Napasakit ng busog ang aking mga kamay at daliri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigurado akong hindi ito imbento para sa pangangaso,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,kundi para pahirapan ang mga tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bagaman, kung masakit ang iyong mga kamay at daliri pagkatapos nito,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,at tama lang ito para sa pangangaso ng mga tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas madaling ma-trap ang mga hayop sa anumang kaso.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.57,0:04:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Delikado kang manghuli nang ikaw lang dalawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat bantayan ka ng mga Guard saan ka man pumunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa susunod isasama ko siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.15,0:04:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nga pala, hawak mo pa rin ang post ng head ng guard ng hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kapag bumuti na ang ama ng reyna,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatanggalin ko ang responsibilidad na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.13,0:04:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Eksakto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Para sa iyong kalusugan -
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,tanggap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.37,0:05:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,, Maayos ang lahat. Hindi na kailangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mo akong tanggihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay regalo mula sa hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig mo ba - nagising na ang reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang pakiramdam niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa kabutihang palad, malusog ang Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakaya niya ang karamdaman.\NAnong kaginhawaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat kong makita ang Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Diyos ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ngayon ang oras para sa mga pagbisita.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil mas mabuti ang reyna,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,iniwasan namin ang pinakamasamang kinalabasan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako na mismo ang maghahanap ng accounting book.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasamahan kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Aalerto lamang sila nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.33,0:06:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bantayan ang lahat ng nangyayari sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda ang panahon ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ito mahuhuli!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang amoy ng tagsibol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Papakasalan mo ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring hindi ako lumabas nang harapan,\Npero may kambing ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hindi ko alam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.27,0:06:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamahalan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.59,0:07:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto ko talagang bumalik siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,At tanging alaala niya lang ang bumalik.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.39,0:07:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dati silang lumalabas na parang mga flash dito at doon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tuwing sumasakit ang ulo ko at tumutunog ang tenga ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit sa pagkakataong ito ay lumitaw ang mga alaala nang walang mga espesyal na epekto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Honyoung, 19 ka na ngayong taon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero hindi Hongyeon ang pangalan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hon ay isang apelyido, at ang iyong pangalan ay Yeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang pang-amoy ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.38,0:07:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumutulong ang mga amoy na maalala mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero bakit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganun ba ako kahusay sa paglalaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Naglaro ka na ng gayageum mula pagkabata.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumalik ang iyong memorya,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,dito nagising ang mga talento.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong kalokohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.47,0:08:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Noong gulay ako, nagkamali ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit naging babae ang boses sa ulo mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,nawalan ng boses?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinasabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Naririnig kita nang perpekto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumalik ang lakas sa mga daliri ko,\Npero nawala na ang boses ko. Parang
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.57,0:08:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,sa "The Little Mermaid"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Alamin ito para walang duda sa mga salita ng saksi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,na nagbebenta ng arsenic sa court lady Khan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:35.04, Default,,0,0,0,,parang lason para sa mga daga, at kung paano nakapasok ang lason sa kusina ng hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,May negosyo ako sa pinuno ng Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang palasyo ay palaging malaki,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:53.83, Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit ngayon ay napakalaki at walang laman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Darating ang kanyang Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ba...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumayag akong bigyan ng oras ang Inang Reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ano?\N-Iyan ang utos
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,, courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghihintay kami sa ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.81,0:09:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit ihanda ang lahat ng ebidensya,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,upang gamitin ang mga ito anumang oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Itago mo sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Siguro nagawa naming pagsama-samahin ang buong larawan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit maaaring konektado ang Inang Reyna
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,sa mga gustong manakit sa reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung hahayaan natin siyang mag-isa,\N maaaring nasa panganib na naman ang Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mga taong gustong saktan ang reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,, Inamin ng Reyna na gusto niyang magpakamatay sa pamamagitan ng pagtapon sa kanyang sarili sa lawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa pagkakataong ito ay nabigo ang kanyang kalusugan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.47,0:10:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang pinag-uusapan natin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay naging target sa sandaling tumawid siya sa threshold ng palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ang nag-aalala sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.58,0:10:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiintindihan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mag-organize ng meeting na walang hari -
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,ang sakit ng ulo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pupunta ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.09,0:10:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,May nangyari ba sa Kanyang Kamahalan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumunta siya sa reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Benin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.93,0:10:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam na nandito ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang magpatuloy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mabuti para makauwi ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanghali na,\Nbakit mo siya pinauwi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako nakatulog buong gabi, kaya nagkamali ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.18,0:10:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ginagawa mo, dahil nalilito mo ang araw sa gabi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Buong gabi akong nasa isang secret mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.16,0:11:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Naranasan ko ang ganoong takot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, may natutunan ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Benin, naliligaw ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nainlove sa isang babaeng hindi dapat ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At sino siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Para sa ilang kadahilanan, ang palasyo ay lalong walang laman ngayon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,walang laman at nasa puso ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Patuloy kong iniisip kung ano ang mali sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,At ngayon sa palasyo mayroon lamang
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,isang babae.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nainlove na yata ako sa reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ano?\N-Paano ako maiinlove sa kapatid ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.83,0:11:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Labag ito sa batas sa incest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.43,0:11:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Galing kami sa iisang pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Parehas ito ng incest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Para bang hindi ito sapat - siya ay isang estranghero at kasal sa hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,baliw ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, mahina lang,\NI nawala lahat ng utak ko sa kalsada.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit kalimutan mo ang lahat ng ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.24,0:11:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,mas mahalaga -
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,mas matanda siya sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Normal ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala ka pa rin ba sa edad niya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo ako sinisigawan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalokohan ang sinasabi mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala na akong sasabihin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, maayos ang lahat.\NPaumanhin sa pagsigaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ako pinagtaasan ng boses,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,at hindi ako kailanman nagalit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ng appointment mo, marami kang pinagbago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayroon kaming sapat na gawin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako nagalit sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano ka nakarating sa ganitong konklusyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Lahat sa paligid ay nagpapaalala sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano niya hinawakan ang payong ng Reyna,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,habang nanatili siya sa tabi niya,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,habang tumakbo siya dala ang decoction para sa Kanyang Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.52,0:12:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang naiisip ko lang ay si Hong Young, ang inaabangan ng reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung iniisip mo si Hong Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,bakit mo naisipang umibig ka sa reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.57,0:12:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakalimutan mo na ba kung sino ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ang ika-16 na inapo at unang anak
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa 3 henerasyon sa pamilya ng mga hukom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako si Kim Hwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pwede ba akong umibig sa ilang court lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Samakatuwid, sigurado ako na sa aking puso...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nainlove na ba ako sa court lady?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck sa iyo sa matitinik na landas ng pag-ibig.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:23.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Paunang tagubilin para sa mga bata
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.84,0:13:33.71,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Cho Hwajin
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:54.83,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:14:00.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nasaan ang hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:02.47,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Pumunta siya sa bahay ng reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:05.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bakit biglaan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.11,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Namulat ang Reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:09.95,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Gusto niyang samantalahin ang pagkakataong halughugin ang kanyang bahay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:15.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nasasaktan ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:17.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Walang problema.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:24.63,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Tapos bibisitahin ko rin ang reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.97,0:14:39.58,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ano ang utang ko sa ganoong kasiyahan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:57.99,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Payat,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.73,0:15:00.43,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,kapal,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:03.13,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,high
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:04.90,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,at mababa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:07.67,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Lahat ay may iba't ibang laki at taas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:10.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ngunit lahat sila ay may iisang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:12.31,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ito
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:15.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,iyong mga mata.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.25,0:15:19.85,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ikaw ang may pinakamagandang pananaw at layunin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.18,0:15:23.19,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Kayo ang mga shooters na personal kong pinili.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:26.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At mayroon akong average na taas at timbang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:27.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Anong uri ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:29.59,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Magiging slow-witted ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:36.13,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At iyon ang tinawag kong squad mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:38.10,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Les Miserables.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:40.67,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Ipinadala ka sa front line,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.67,0:15:43.14,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,dahil itinuring silang nonentities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:45.07,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Ngunit sa mga baril na ito
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:48.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,ikaw ang magiging pinakamahusay na mandirigma ng Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:50.75,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Tulad ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:57.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ang baril ay maaaring kumitil ng buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.36,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ngunit din
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:08.76,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,maaaring iligtas siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.47,0:16:11.30,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Pumila ng limang magkasunod para kunan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:21.04,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Magulo, ngunit kailangan kong iligtas ang bansang ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:25.71,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Sunog!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:35.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Pumunta ako para kunin ang kailangan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.89,0:16:39.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ang una ay isang hairpin na may phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.80,Default,Spillikin,0,0,0,,Phoenix hairpin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:44.90,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Isang regalo para sa reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:48.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kung para sa reyna, hihilingin ni NI si Saniyvon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:53.88,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kailangan ng golden royal hairpin na may phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:56.04,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Kailangan ko yung gawa sa jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:17:00.92,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Ngunit alinsunod sa royal etiquette, ang reyna lamang
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:04.02,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,maaaring magsuot ng phoenix hairpins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:05.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Eksakto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:13.46,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At ang pangalawang bagay na kailangan ko ay...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:21.50,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Alam ko. Gusto niyang akitin ang hari doon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:26.64,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Sa halip. Kailangan nating tapusin sa isang bala.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:29.21,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Oo. Mas mabilis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:36.29,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Bago ibunyag ng reyna ang sikreto sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:43.73,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,May isang pagkakaiba sa pagitan ko at ng maliit na sirena.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:47.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nakuha niya ang mga binti para sa kanyang boses, at nakuha ko ang mga armas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:50.13,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Surprise after surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:52.27,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kaya mawawala ba ako sa sarili ko sa bawat patak?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:54.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kung mananatili ako rito,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:57.77,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,makukuha ng bastard na iyon, Director Khan,\N ang lahat ng gusto niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:17:59.98,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Maaari kong akusahan ang kanyang mga ninuno ng pagtataksil,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:02.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,hanapin ang mga Khan at sirain ang buong clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.68,0:18:05.58,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,wasak ko ang tatlong henerasyon ng mga Khan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,para hindi nila siya maisip.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:11.39,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ngunit saang angkan sila kabilang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.99,0:18:14.46,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bakit patuloy na nagbabago ang mood niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:22.70,Default,Biryulka,0,0,0,,Kayong lahat ba ay taga-Namsadan troupe dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:24.07,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Saan nagmula ang mga ganoong kasanayan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.53,0:18:27.67,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Para sa mga babaeng Joseon ito ay wala.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:30.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ito ang tanging paraan upang tumingin sa likod ng mga pader.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.77,0:18:34.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung ano ang malalim na kahulugan nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:37.55,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Totoo ito. Matapos ang isang linggong paninirahan dito, napagtanto ko
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:40.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,na ang buhay ng isang Joseon na babae ay mas mahirap kaysa sa inaasahan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:42.78,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And by the way, ako rin ang reyna dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:47.92,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Pero kung makakapaghiganti ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:49.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:54.40,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Magiging maayos ang lahat kung hindi ka maamoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:55.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi na babalik ang mga alaala.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:57.47,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At babalik ang boses ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:19:00.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Mula sa araw na ito mabubuhay ako para sa paghihiganti.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:03.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At para dito kailangan ko ng kapangyarihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:04.94,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hon Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:08.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ano, bilang isang reyna, ang dapat kong gawin para makakuha ng walang katulad na kapangyarihan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:11.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Alam ko ang pinakamahusay na paraan para makakuha ng kapangyarihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:14.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Alin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:17.75,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Ang paggawa ng tagapagmana ay magbibigay sa iyo ng pinakamalaking kapangyarihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:20.92,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Production?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:22.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Anong uri ng hindi makataong salita ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.29,0:19:25.39,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Eksakto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:28.46,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Para sa akin, ang napakalakas na Sunwon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:30.10,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Sino si Sunwon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:32.23,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ganyan ang pangalan ng nayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:35.07,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Queen Sunwon. Siya ang Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.41,0:19:39.31,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Hong Young, kung gusto ko siyang mapabilib,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:42.14,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-ano ang kailangan ko...\N-Magsilang ng tagapagmana. Eksakto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:44.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bibigyan ko siya ng regalo. Ano ang maiisip mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:47.62,Default,Spillkins,0,0,0,,Isang bagay na maliit, makintab,\N mahal at maganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.45,0:19:50.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Maghintay ng isang minuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:54.29,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Yung amoy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:59.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bumalik ang mga alaala, bumalik...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:22.68,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Ang storage na ito ay tinatawag na Sky. Ang nasa likod-bahay ay ang Lupa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:24.25,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At ang nasa tabi ng guest room ay Black?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.25,0:20:26.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Oo. Ang iyong ama ay nakaipon ng kayamanan habang ikaw ay wala.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:28.42,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Lahat ng storage ay puno na.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.42,0:20:31.29,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Sky, Earth, Black...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:35.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kung iisipin mo ang lahat ng mga bodega sa Joseon, at hindi lang ang mga ito...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.16,0:20:37.47,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kailangang gamitin ng iyong pamilya ang lahat ng Chinese na character.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:41.00,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Oh, maliit kong mga mata!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.54,0:20:44.04,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo, ipinanganak akong may gintong kutsara sa aking bibig.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.51,0:20:47.54,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.41,0:20:51.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.78,0:20:54.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At bukod sa kanila,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.85,0:20:57.32,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,pack lahat ng iba pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:20:59.65,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Lahat ng iba?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:02.06,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kunin na natin ang lahat at bumalik sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.99,0:21:05.66,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Masasaktan ang iyong ama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:08.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Mula sa araw na ito, ako na ang magiging reyna ng lobbying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.67,0:21:11.67,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:15.37,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Dumating na ang Hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.91,0:21:18.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bakit kailangan pa ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:20.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Babalik ako kaagad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:22.04,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo sa kanya na hintayin ako sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:25.98,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinasabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.55,0:21:28.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kailangan kong ipakita ang aking debosyon kay lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:29.95,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At lumayo ka sa hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:34.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ano ang ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:49.57,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kailangan kong malinaw na ipakita kung kaninong panig ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.57,0:21:50.74,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Narito siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:54.81,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bakit naka-full dress siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.38,0:21:58.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Lahat ng royal family na ito ay mga show-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:22:00.38,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ipakita mo sa hari ang iyong paggalang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.78,0:22:02.85,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Lahat ay maayos.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.03,0:22:21.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kaya, aprubahan ko si Soyeon mula sa pamilya Kim bilang reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:29.88,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Binabati kita sa iyong halalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:22:59.04,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Kinuha ito habang papunta dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:05.15,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.78,0:23:09.78,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Namula ka. At mas mabilis kang huminga.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.59,0:23:12.25,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nahihirapan ka na bang huminga?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.06,0:23:15.86,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Maayos na ang mukha ko, at normal ang paghinga ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.73,0:23:18.59,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Kumain lang ng sobra sa umaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.69,0:23:20.90,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Umalis ka, Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:23.17,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Lumabas ka sa akin... Ibig sabihin, umalis ka kaagad sa katawan na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.17,0:23:24.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ano ang ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:27.10,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Wala na akong ibang mapupuntahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:29.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ganyan mo ba sirain ang mga bulaklak o ang iyong katawan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.17,0:23:32.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hoy, bakit ka nagpapatuloy...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.28,0:23:34.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Sapat na.\N-Umalis ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.91,0:23:37.98,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi ko ibibigay, akin siya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.98,0:23:41.35,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam na sobrang gusto mo sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.02,0:23:43.25,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi ko sinabing nagustuhan ko ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.25,0:23:45.32,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko lang ay mas mabuting manatili dito kaysa manirahan sa bangkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.32,0:23:48.62,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Paano mo nagagawang gumising ng mas kakaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.59,0:23:52.13,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi lang ako ang kakaiba dito. Marami kang kakaibang bagay sa iyong sarili.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.13,0:23:54.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,"Kinuha sila papunta dito"? Seryoso?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.53,0:23:56.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ilang siglo na ba nilang hinahabol ang gayong blizzard?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:23:58.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Pero sinundo ko talaga sila sa kalsada.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:24:01.17,Default,Spikyulka,0,0,0,,Well, oo, siyempre, mahusay, bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.17,0:24:03.31,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Totoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.31,0:24:04.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Naniniwala talaga ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.41,0:24:07.44,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Hindi nagsisinungaling ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.44,0:24:10.01,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Well, yes, well, yes, yeah, yeah.\N-Ano ang nangyayari sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.01,0:24:13.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Paano iyon? Ano ito?\N-Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.58,0:24:16.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.19,0:24:21.69,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Pinagpala mo ang aming abang tahanan sa iyong pagbisita.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.16,0:24:24.39,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Salamat, Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.09,0:24:26.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Mangyaring tumayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.90,0:24:32.23,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kinailangan kong tingnan ang aking reyna at siguraduhing maayos ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.77,0:24:35.40,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kumusta ka? okay ka lang ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.40,0:24:37.31,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Oo, siyempre.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.07,0:24:40.44,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Pumasok na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.21,0:24:42.64,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Siyempre.\N-Magaling.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.78,0:24:48.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Aking hari, tamasahin ang mabuting pakikitungo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.08,0:24:50.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At kailangan kong maghanda para bumalik sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.49,0:24:52.65,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Tara na.\N-Ano? Aalis ka na ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:55.52,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang bumalik sa palasyo ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.63,0:24:58.33,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Mabilis akong gumaling.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.73,0:25:00.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kahit na,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.06,0:25:04.03,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,kaka-recover mo lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.03,0:25:05.67,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Tama si Itay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.20,0:25:09.17,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi na kailangang magmadali, kailangan mong ganap na makabawi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.28,0:25:16.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala na ang courtyard ay lalaban nang wala ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.15,0:25:18.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Kalmado ang lahat sa looban.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.88,0:25:20.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mas kalmado kaysa noong nasa palasyo ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.95,0:25:24.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mas kalmado.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.49,0:25:26.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Paumanhin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.12,0:25:29.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I tried my best,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.79,0:25:33.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,pero parang hindi ka masaya sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.70,0:25:36.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Oo, ako...\N-Sanay ka na sa palasyo
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.77,0:25:39.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,at gumugol ng oras sa aking ama
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.00,0:25:41.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,hindi mo ito gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.57,0:25:43.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.77,0:25:48.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nag-focus ako sa pagtupad sa tungkulin ng aking reyna
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:51.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,at hindi ko man lang inisip ang nararamdaman mo, ama.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.08,0:25:55.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Babalik ako sa palasyo bukas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.05,0:26:01.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Kung gayon, iniimbitahan ko kayong dalawa sa guest house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.83,0:26:05.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nahulog sa isang trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.26,0:26:08.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.97,0:26:15.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Anong langaw ang kumagat sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.68,0:26:34.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,May gawain para sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.35,0:26:38.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Dalhan mo ako ng hindi dapat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.06,0:26:47.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mula sa isang taguan sa mga silid ng ama ng reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.50,0:26:49.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.34,0:26:59.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Natutuwa akong makita kang magkasama dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.77,0:27:02.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sobrang saya na wala akong pakialam na mamatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.54,0:27:05.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Dapat kanina pa kita binisita. \NI pasensya na.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.75,0:27:08.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Walang dapat ihingi ng paumanhin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.42,0:27:12.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sapat na para marinig ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.92,0:27:18.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,kung paano ninyo mahal ang isa't isa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.96,0:27:25.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ibang-iba ang reyna ko sa ibang babae,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:28.67,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,Palagi akong interesadong makita kung saan siya lumaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.67,0:27:32.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ito ang lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.71,0:27:34.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Pinalaki ko siyang mag-isa, walang ina,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.24,0:27:37.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,kaya sinubukan ko lalo na
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.08,0:27:39.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,ibigay sa kanya ang lahat ng pangangalagang kailangan niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.68,0:27:41.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mahirap siguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.32,0:27:44.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Well, hindi naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.12,0:27:47.29,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Maganda ang ginawa ng Reyna sa kanyang sarili
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.32,0:27:49.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,mula sa murang edad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.33,0:27:54.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Oo, narinig ko iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.03,0:27:57.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Gayunpaman, siya ay napakalakas at nagsasarili,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.37,0:27:59.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,para sa hindi pagbabahagi ng kanyang nararamdaman sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.03,0:28:01.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,, Ganun na ba ako katanga?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.10,0:28:04.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,O imposibleng maunawaan kung ano ang nasa isip ng isang babae?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.91,0:28:08.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Napakahirap para sa akin na intindihin siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.14,0:28:11.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Diyos, tiyak na hindi ito dahil sa kakulangan ng katalinuhan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.75,0:28:13.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lahat ng lalaki ay nahihirapang intindihin ang mga babae.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.08,0:28:17.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ang mga ito ay kasing kumplikado ng mga turo ng Buddha.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.52,0:28:19.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Huwag subukang intindihin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.32,0:28:23.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ang relasyong mag-asawa ay binubuo ng hindi pagkakaunawaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.09,0:28:26.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig sabihin nito?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.20,0:28:28.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Walang hindi pagkakaunawaan
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.70,0:28:31.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,hindi talaga magpapakasal ang mga tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.00,0:28:39.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Gusto kong malaman ang lahat tungkol sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.48,0:28:45.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Itigil mo na.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.05,0:28:46.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Gusto kong makita ang bahay,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.61,0:28:48.22,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,kung saan siya lumaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.22,0:28:49.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Magagawa ko ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.95,0:28:52.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Masaya akong mamasyal kasama ang reyna at maabutan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.95,0:28:55.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang ordinaryong bahay ng isang mangangalakal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.49,0:28:56.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Walang espesyal,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.93,0:28:59.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,ngunit ikalulugod kong ipakita sa iyo ang lahat dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:02.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay sumabay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.20,0:29:04.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Dapat sumama sa akin ang Reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.10,0:29:08.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hindi kami nagkita ng isang gabi,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.37,0:29:11.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,pero nami-miss kita kahit nakatingin ako sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.04,0:29:15.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,May na-stuck ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.98,0:29:17.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang nunal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.85,0:29:23.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Parang iba ka ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.42,0:29:29.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Dapat kang sumama sa amin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.99,0:29:31.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let's go?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.59,0:29:35.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Maghintay. Dalawa kayong naglalaan ng oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.80,0:29:41.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Titingnan ko kung nalinis lahat ng kwarto.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.08,0:29:48.21,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Paumanhin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.01,0:29:53.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.25,0:29:54.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Distansya, hindi mo ba naaalala?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.88,0:29:58.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,, Habang tumatagal ang iniisip ko, mas nagiging makabuluhan ang parirala.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.42,0:30:01.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Kahit hindi tayo magkasundo sa lahat,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.76,0:30:03.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,masaya tayong makakasama.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.43,0:30:06.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ito ay kahanga-hanga, tama?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.53,0:30:09.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Pagtanggap sa aming mga pagkakaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.23,0:30:12.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,at pagtagumpayan sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.20,0:30:13.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Naging pilosopo ka na ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.97,0:30:16.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Saan ka dinala ng “distancing”?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.21,0:30:21.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh, eksakto. Pagkatapos ng lahat, ikaw ay isang pulitiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.74,0:30:25.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nakita mo kung gaano kasaya ang tatay ko nang makita niya kaming magkasama.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.15,0:30:28.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sinusubukan kong maging mabuting manugang, tulungan mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.95,0:30:33.25,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.30,0:30:52.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lahat ng mga katulong ay mukhang hindi pangkaraniwang malakas
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.44,0:30:53.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,at magaling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.28,0:30:57.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Alam nila ang layout ng bahay tulad ng likod ng kanilang kamay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.08,0:30:59.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Tara na.\N-Syempre.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.73,0:31:13.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Natutuwa akong hiniling ko sa iyo na ipakita ang lahat dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.90,0:31:18.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Siyempre, may mga napakahalagang bagay dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.87,0:31:20.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So. Dito, halimbawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.40,0:31:24.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Puting porselana at folding screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.54,0:31:27.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hindi ko sila madaling nakuha.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.71,0:31:31.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Pwede ko bang tingnang mabuti?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.95,0:31:33.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Oo, siyempre.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.58,0:31:35.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo dito...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.46,0:31:43.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Walang interesante sa kabilang panig.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.19,0:31:47.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Maging ang reverse side ng isang gawa ng sining ay mukhang katangi-tangi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.43,0:31:52.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mag-ingat ka, reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.60,0:31:56.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Ano ito?\N-Sa iyong nakakasilaw na kagandahan
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.87,0:31:58.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,maging ang mga bubuyog ay dumagsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.17,0:32:01.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Mga bubuyog?\N-Saan?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.81,0:32:03.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Saan?\N-Ayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.85,0:32:05.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Mag-ingat ka.\N-Walang bubuyog dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.02,0:32:08.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Saan? Nasaan sila?\N-God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.62,0:32:11.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Nasaan sila?\N-Parang lumipad sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:16.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My queen, ano ang masasabi mo sa screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.83,0:32:25.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Malakas na stroke, napakagandang landscape painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.77,0:32:27.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Darling, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.97,0:32:32.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Marahil natatakot kang baka manakaw ang iyong mga mahahalagang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.54,0:32:37.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sigurado akong marami kang bantay na magbabantay sa kanila sa gabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.88,0:32:42.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hindi, wala akong bantay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.65,0:32:46.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mas katulad ng mga upahang guwardiya ngayon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.59,0:32:49.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,nakawin ang dapat nilang protektahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.09,0:32:51.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Kung gayon paano?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.43,0:32:54.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nagsanay ako ng ilang katulong na nagtatrabaho para sa akin,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.30,0:32:56.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,na pinagkakatiwalaan ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.46,0:32:58.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,nagsasagawa sila ng mga tungkuling bantay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.37,0:33:01.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mas mura ito kaysa kumuha ng mga sinanay na guwardiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.34,0:33:04.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Napakatalino mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.07,0:33:07.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,At ilan ang mga katulong na mayroon ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.68,0:33:14.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ito ay classified na impormasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.25,0:33:19.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Kung gayon hindi mo na kailangang sabihin sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.06,0:33:22.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Gayunpaman, nananatili rito ang aking reyna,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.42,0:33:24.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.06,0:33:26.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.83,0:33:31.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,26-27 sa isang lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.47,0:33:37.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Walang lihim sa pagitan natin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.98,0:33:44.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mayroon kang sapat na mga tao para ipagtanggol ang isang 9-room estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.11,0:33:47.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Napatahimik ako ng iyong mga salita.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.62,0:33:49.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nag-alinlangan ako kung mayroon kang mga lumang libro,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.75,0:33:51.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,na may petsang dalawang siglo na ang nakalipas.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.42,0:33:56.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hindi sapat ang pera lang para magkaroon ng ganoong mga libro.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.19,0:33:59.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Labis kang magugulat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.69,0:34:02.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Talaga? Nagulat?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.20,0:34:09.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sa daan papunta sa library makikita mo
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.94,0:34:11.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,ang umbrella pine tree na inalagaan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.27,0:34:16.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ang hugis ng korona nito ay kahawig ng isang phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.05,0:34:21.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Narinig ko na kung magtatanim ka ng puno,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.32,0:34:23.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,may lalabas na reyna sa pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.12,0:34:27.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Gumagana ang sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.92,0:34:30.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Malapit na. Sumunod ka sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.16,0:34:32.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Devil's pine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.73,0:34:34.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ngayong taglamig gagamitin ko ito para sa panggatong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.73,0:34:39.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Natutuwa akong marinig muli ang iyong mga bastos at mayabang na pananalita.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.74,0:34:42.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sa una, kapag nagbago ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.37,0:34:45.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Akala ko inaabuso mo ang kapangyarihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.81,0:34:47.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Akala mo kasama ang iyong mga kamag-anak
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.81,0:34:49.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,sinusubukan akong yurakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.41,0:34:51.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hindi pagkakaunawaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.85,0:34:53.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,At ikaw lang...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.15,0:34:55.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.62,0:34:57.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mayabang lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.95,0:35:02.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Galing ako sa mayamang pamilya. kayang kaya ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.79,0:35:05.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hindi ako nagbibiro noong sinabi kong gusto kitang intindihin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.50,0:35:09.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Gusto kong malaman,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.10,0:35:13.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,kung paano naging katulad mo ang isang babae mula sa isang marangal na pamilya sa Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.84,0:35:16.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Huwag mo nang subukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.77,0:35:19.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ang isang babaeng tulad ko ay hindi maaaring mag-exist sa Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.44,0:35:22.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,"Ako ang pinakamakapangyarihan sa mundong ito."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.21,0:35:24.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Talagang mayabang ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.09,0:35:39.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Masakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.61,0:35:52.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ang pagbabalik ng hari sa trono pagkatapos ng pagbagsak
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.91,0:35:54.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ang pagbabalik ng hari sa trono pagkatapos ng pagbagsak
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.27,0:36:21.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyari sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.87,0:36:25.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Wala.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.38,0:36:28.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.41,0:36:32.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ang kanyang kalusugan ay lumala dahil sa pag-aalala tungkol sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.68,0:36:35.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Tatawag ako ng tulong para ihatid ka sa loob.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.65,0:36:37.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Bantayan mo siya hanggang sa makabalik ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.10,0:36:50.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:52.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nakakita ka ba ng multo?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.27,0:36:59.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ang amoy ng dampness...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.34,0:37:04.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Iligtas mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.48,0:37:07.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Kasalanan ko. Ako ang may kasalanan sa pagkamatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.12,0:37:12.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sa balon na ito...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.60,0:37:26.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.57,0:37:59.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Tulungan ang hari. Bilisan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.40,0:38:01.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Chief concubine?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.10,0:38:04.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyari?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.91,0:38:06.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Namutla ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.24,0:38:08.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Talaga...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.95,0:38:13.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ama, samahan mo ang hari sa loob.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.35,0:38:20.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mukhang dumating ang concubine para kausapin ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.46,0:38:23.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Pumunta ako dito na nag-aalala sa kalusugan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.82,0:38:25.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Pero mukhang masama ang pakiramdam ng hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.99,0:38:27.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyari?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.50,0:38:30.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hindi ako nakatulog kagabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.87,0:38:33.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nahilo ako saglit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.30,0:38:35.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sasamahan kita sa guest house.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.57,0:38:36.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Tinawag na ang doktor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.37,0:38:39.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kailangan ng healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.74,0:38:42.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Magpapahinga ako at magiging maayos ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.31,0:38:45.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Mas mabilis. Tulungan ang Kanyang Kamahalan.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.18,0:38:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mag-ingat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.13,0:39:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mag-ingat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.31,0:39:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang pumunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.31,0:39:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang humiga?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.35,0:39:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.78,0:39:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Uupo ako sandali at magpapahinga.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.05,0:39:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nabalitaan kong hindi mo gaanong naaalala ang oras mo sa Hanyang,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.23,0:39:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,bata ka pa noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.77,0:39:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bata pa ako noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.34,0:39:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil sa isang hindi magandang pangyayari, umalis ako sa Hanyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.64,0:39:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong masyadong maalala.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.94,0:39:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakaluwag.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.21,0:39:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibig sabihin, gusto kong sabihin na mas mabuting bitawan
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.05,0:39:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,masamang alaala.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.52,0:40:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.86,0:40:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Binuksan ng tangang ito ang kahon ng Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.40,0:40:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ikaw ang sinasabi nila.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.73,0:40:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero nagdududa pa rin ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.30,0:40:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala. Wala akong sinabi sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.51,0:40:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba iyon ang dahilan kung bakit ka nandito?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.21,0:40:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,At ano ang gusto mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.15,0:40:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Naakit mo siya dito nang may dahilan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.05,0:40:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto ko talagang makasama ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.09,0:40:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ang huling pag-asa ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.66,0:40:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Habang gusto kita,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.29,0:40:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya ko ang sarili ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.30,0:40:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero nalaman ko ang totoo tungkol sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.47,0:40:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tungkol sa pagiging pekeng Kim So-yeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.68,0:41:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinawagan mo ako
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.22,0:41:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,pekeng?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.49,0:41:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Naalala ko lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.95,0:41:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukhang ipinakita mo ang iyong tunay na kulay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.36,0:41:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tutulungan kita, dahil nagngangalit ang hormones ko sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.80,0:41:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipagtapat ang lahat sa hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.86,0:41:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Masakit para sa kanya na malaman ito mula sa ibang tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.00,0:41:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinatakot mo ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.54,0:41:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig kita nang malinaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.98,0:41:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamahalan, dinalhan kita ng magagaan na meryenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.69,0:41:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaano kahirap na maabot siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.62,0:41:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakapit siya sa isang komplikadong relasyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.49,0:41:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya nalito ako sa sarili ko. Spoiled na babae.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.43,0:41:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumasok.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.61,0:42:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.81,0:42:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakausap mo na ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.38,0:42:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Iwan mo kami sandali.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.92,0:42:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.15,0:42:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin sa pag-aalala sa iyo tungkol sa mga walang kabuluhang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.59,0:42:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No need for formalities, solo tayo dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.00,0:42:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamahalan,\Ngagaling na ang reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.77,0:42:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumalik na tayo sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.37,0:42:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.61,0:42:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,May kailangan akong pag-aralan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.85,0:42:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,May pag-aaralan?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.85,0:42:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ba talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.45,0:42:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.22,0:42:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Patawarin mo ako sa aking masamang ugali.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.29,0:42:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Naghanda ako ng kwarto para sa iyo. Hayaan mong ihatid kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.83,0:42:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat akong bumalik sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.50,0:43:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hihintayin kita sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.67,0:43:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Alagaan ang iyong sarili.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.88,0:44:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang kanyang lolo ay si Prinsipe Eunong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.68,0:44:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay inakusahan ng pagtataksil, ipinatapon at pinatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.92,0:44:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang kanyang ama ay si Prinsipe Jeongye.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.35,0:44:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanirahan sa pagkatapon kasama ang kanyang ama,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.02,0:44:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,may sakit at namatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.89,0:44:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Napatay ang kanyang lola at tiyahin dahil sa kanilang binyag,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.39,0:44:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,at half-brother ni Lee Won-kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.00,0:44:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,pinatay dahil sa pagtataksil.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.40,0:44:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito palabas sa TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.24,0:44:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit namatay ang lahat sa kanyang pamilya?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.68,0:44:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ganyan ka makatingin sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.41,0:44:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang hitsura ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.62,0:44:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Para akong isang kaawa-awang aso.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.05,0:44:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi na kailangang ngumiti. Nag-aalala ako sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.56,0:44:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Malamang, ito ang dahilan kung bakit nakakasama lamang ang maagang edukasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.36,0:44:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong walang kwentang kaalaman!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.90,0:45:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw. Ano ang gusto mo sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.00,0:45:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka dumikit sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.17,0:45:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang gusto ko sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.81,0:45:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung biglang makialam ang reyna sa ating mga plano,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.08,0:45:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako mismo ang pupugutan ng ulo niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.69,0:45:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong huwag kang makialam sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.96,0:45:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ako kailangang tulungan. Basta
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.53,0:45:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,huwag kang maging kaaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.73,0:45:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,At may sanay kang mata.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.40,0:45:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring wala akong masyadong maitutulong sa anumang bagay,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.64,0:45:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit bilang isang kaaway ako ay kahila-hilakbot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.07,0:45:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hahawakan kita at hindi ako bibitaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.61,0:45:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamahalan!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.31,0:45:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Napunta sa iyo si Kim Byonin.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.83,0:46:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ilang bisita ang mayroon ako ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.94,0:46:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Lalapit sa akin ang mga tao na parang pupunta ako sa isang restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.15,0:46:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.65,0:46:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Masyadong maganda, sasabihin ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.15,0:46:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Anumang mga problema?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.66,0:46:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit nandito ang head ng Detective Department?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.96,0:46:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Habang nandito ang hari at reyna,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.93,0:46:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,dapat parang palasyo dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.33,0:46:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.33,0:46:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mula ngayon, nasa ilalim ka ng proteksyon ng Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.30,0:46:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinala ko ang mga royal guards, wala kang dapat ipag-alala.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.21,0:46:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon ikaw ay nasa ilalim ng proteksyon ng mga maharlikang guwardiya,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.81,0:46:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,at poprotektahan namin ang reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.98,0:46:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakaraming tao ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.98,0:47:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay maaalala mo ang mga royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.20,0:47:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakatayo ka sa maling lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.07,0:47:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Para protektahan kami,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.10,0:47:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,tumingin sa paligid, hindi sa amin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.11,0:47:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumbaga, ang tadhana ko ay mapaligiran ng mga tumitingin sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.46,0:47:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.38,0:48:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay na ang lahat?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.45,0:48:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Teka, ito...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.45,0:48:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit siya nandito?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.36,0:48:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kilala mo ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.99,0:48:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Malay mo, gumising ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.13,0:48:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Iligtas mo ako, Benin.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.83,0:48:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Benin?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.84,0:48:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit niya sinubukang atakihin ang reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.67,0:48:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring nasaktan siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.74,0:48:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Umalis ka na, babae! Umalis ka sa katawang ito!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.74,0:48:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Umalis ka na.\N-Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.95,0:48:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nakalimutan ng chatterbox na ito dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.33,0:48:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang iniisip mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.56,0:48:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto ko talagang makita ang mukha niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.87,0:48:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.14,0:49:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa Joseon I...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.47,0:49:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.51,0:49:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.12,0:49:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto niyang makita ang maid mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.35,0:49:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi niya ba talaga ako nakikilala ng ganito?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.23,0:49:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi mo poprotektahan mo ang reyna,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.50,0:49:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit ipinakita lamang ang kanilang kahinaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.53,0:49:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka malungkot?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.13,0:49:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,, Detective department?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.87,0:49:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,May gagawin ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.64,0:49:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang maaari kong gawin?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.78,0:49:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming bodega ang ninakawan sa kabisera kamakailan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.25,0:49:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ano kaya?\N-Kailangan nating palakasin ang mga hakbang sa seguridad.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.58,0:49:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit kung pipigilan mo ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.25,0:49:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,posible bang kumita ka dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.13,0:49:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Madali, sa kabila ng kanyang nakaraan,\N isa pa rin siyang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.33,0:50:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngayon malalaman natin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.37,0:50:09.84,Default,Tira,0,0,0,,Sobrang saya.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.85,0:50:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako mismo ay isang bihasang mandirigma, at mayroon akong tamang instincts,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.72,0:50:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi masyadong mahirap\N para sa akin na umiwas sa mga suntok.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.46,0:50:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,May gusto akong pag-usapan sa iyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.60,0:50:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya naman hiniling kong sumama ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.13,0:50:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo? yun lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.57,0:50:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,At mayroon din akong isang kahilingan para sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.17,0:50:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung mahihiling ko ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.24,0:50:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong uri ng kahilingan?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.18,0:50:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ihihipan mo ba ang mga pasa ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.19,0:51:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit hininga mo ay mabango.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.83,0:51:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngayon ako ay ganap na nalilito, ano ngayon
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.30,0:51:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,nararanasan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.94,0:51:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Isa lang ang paraan para sigurado.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.78,0:51:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin nang maaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.31,0:51:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero kailangan kong malaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.66,0:51:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.93,0:51:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin sa hindi pagkilala sa ganoong mahalagang asawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.76,0:51:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong klaseng ngiti yan?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.97,0:51:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang ngiti na humihingi ako ng tawad.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.27,0:51:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mabango ang hininga ko, at mas maganda ang ngiti ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.93,0:52:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,At marami kang alam tungkol sa pag-inom.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.04,0:52:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw mismo ay nakakapagparaya sa alkohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.44,0:52:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre, kaya ako ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.24,0:53:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganyan na ba sila karami?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.48,0:53:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, eto na, that’s the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.38,0:53:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-ERV.\N-ERV?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.09,0:53:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Panahon ng aso at lobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.62,0:53:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang oras kung kailan ang lahat ng mga belo ay napunit,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.80,0:53:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,yung mga mapayapang nabuhay sa maghapon\N nag-aagawan na parang aso at lobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.45,0:53:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sagutin mo ako bilang asawa sa asawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.76,0:53:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala ka
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.33,0:53:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,wala ka bang nararamdaman para sa aking reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.76,0:53:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,, Tanging nararamdaman para sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.03,0:53:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,maaaring ipaliwanag ang iyong poot sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.27,0:54:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayroong lahat ng uri ng asno sa mundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.67,0:54:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,May mga mismong\N walang nararamdaman para sa birhen,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.65,0:54:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi sila makakapayag na may kasama siyang iba.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.42,0:54:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ba ang bossy ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.50,0:54:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tabi mo ay ang pinakamahusay sa mga babae,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.17,0:54:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,at hindi mo ito napapansin.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.74,0:54:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Parang kumakain ng asno, isang ganap na tanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.31,0:54:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.11,0:54:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako interesado sa sinuman sa inyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.85,0:54:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsisinungaling ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.22,0:54:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong gusto mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.69,0:54:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumingin ka sa aking mga mata.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.37,0:55:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,O ikaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.94,0:55:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang isang matalinong hari ay dapat maging kampante,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.58,0:55:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit akin ang tagumpay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.69,0:55:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakatawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.02,0:55:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Panahon na para suklian mo ang kabutihan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.20,0:56:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Heto tayo muli.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.27,0:56:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bagaman sinubukan kong lumayo,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.17,0:56:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,para hindi ka na maabala pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.04,0:56:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit, Inang Reyna, hindi mo man lang ako ginugulo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.77,0:56:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,May regalo ako sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.59,0:56:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.59,0:56:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung sinuman ang karapat-dapat na maging malapit sa hari, ikaw iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.59,0:56:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang pamagat ng Her Majesty ay mas bagay sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.94,0:56:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang tinitingnan mo, anak?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.11,0:57:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinahangaan ang repleksyon ng buwan sa tubig.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.38,0:57:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming nakakatakot na kwento ang maririnig sa loob ng dingding ng palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.05,0:57:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tungkol sa mga multo, halimbawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.62,0:57:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Isa sa mga kuwentong ito ay nagsasabi na hindi mo dapat
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.53,0:57:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,tumingin sa tubig ng reservoir kapag full na ang buwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.63,0:57:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil sa sandaling tumalikod ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.44,0:57:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,at ang iyong pagmuni-muni ay magkakaroon ng sarili nitong buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.81,0:57:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.45,0:57:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,parang hanggang ngayon ay nasa ilalim ako ng reservoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.62,0:57:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngayon
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.23,0:57:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,oras na para lumabas.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.55,0:58:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Naghintay sana ako sa matanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.05,0:58:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukhang pinindot ito nang husto.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.42,0:58:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop. Ang nangangailangan ay nasa panig na iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.93,0:59:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,May tinatago ako sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.93,0:59:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang inilihim ko sa lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.87,0:59:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang alam ko lang at ng Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.78,0:59:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa buong buwan, lumiliko ang mga taong lobo
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.68,0:59:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,sa mga lobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.32,0:59:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gayunpaman, tayong lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.45,0:59:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,alam na alam natin na excuse lang ang full moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.06,0:59:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,upang palayain ang lobo na laging nagtatago sa loob.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.96,1:00:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito, isang chamber pot?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.13,1:00:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi magandang gawin ang mga bagay sa ganitong kagandahan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.47,1:01:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tango?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.77,1:02:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Natauhan ka na ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.01,1:02:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Dalhin mo ako sa mga silid ng Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.14,1:02:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Babantayan ko siya ng personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.04,1:03:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Reyna?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.47,1:03:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bastard, bakit mo sinasaktan ang kaawa-awa kong hari?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.28,1:03:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ay may kaparusahan
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.88,1:03:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,sa pangalan ng buwan!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.00,1:03:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaunti lang ang nainom ko,\Nand my grace naging parang patatas.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.36,1:03:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika, bumangon ka na. Maganda pa rin?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.24,1:04:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo inilantad ang iyong sarili sa pag-atake?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.01,1:04:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayan na siya!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.15,1:04:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalimutan na natin ang pagdistansya ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.43,1:04:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.50,1:04:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.14,1:05:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo maiwasang malagay sa gulo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.91,1:05:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakalungkot kung nakalimutan mo kagabi.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.41,1:05:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang palaging bumili ng nameplate.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.28,1:05:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang nakakaalam? Bigla na lang siyang nasa ibang tao
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.25,1:05:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,sumukay dito para magsimula ng rebelyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.02,1:05:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kasalanan ko ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.82,1:05:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinailangan kong itikom ang aking bibig.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.96,1:05:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumawa tayo ng konting foray.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.26,1:05:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ingratiates himself with the Kims,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.96,1:05:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,na halos buong pamilya niya ang kinatay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.66,1:05:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Magsalita, ngunit huwag magsalita.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.96,1:05:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sino ka pa? \N-ako
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.50,1:05:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyembro ako ng fan club ng hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,


